MODULE native.cli.formalization.claims.

// A small formalization-claims graph: a Lean declaration formalizes a claim
// and requires a requirement; the rule derives which requirements each claim
// rests on. See README.md for the native CLI walkthrough.

lean:Parser.parse#formalizes@claim:parserContract.
lean:Parser.parse#requires@requirement:inputGrammar.

RULE claimRequirement:
IF ?declaration#formalizes@?claim AND ?declaration#requires@?requirement
THEN ?claim#requires_claim@?requirement.

QUERY claim_requirements:
FIND ?claim ?requirement WHERE ?claim#requires_claim@?requirement.
